#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/changes.rst:2038
msgid ""
"NEW: Adding a fully tested data set manager that lets users "
"add/remove/modify attribute arrays to a tvtk dataset. This is fully tested "
"and also does not influence any other code. [21300]"
