"BUG: Added a test case for the hide/show functionality and fixed known bugs."
msgstr "バグ:非表示/表示機能のテストケースが追加され，既知のバグが修正されました．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/changes.rst:2228
msgid ""
"API: Adding elementary support for texturing an actor (if it has texture "
"coords).  This was thanks to a patch from Chandrashekhar Kaushik. [18827]"
